#
# N10 - a capability gap naming no blocked step, so the absent OCR capability is
# reported as a general provisioning complaint rather than a concrete blockage a
# proposal could close. MUST trip logic:OperationalGapNamesBlockedStepConstraint. NOT
# logic:OperationalGapCarriesProposalConstraint: that law joins the gap to its remedy
# THROUGH the shared step, and its guard binds that step, so a gap naming none falls
# outside it. The substitution is ocr-gap-remedied-for-a-different-step.ttl.

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:   <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/logic/tests/> .

ex:ocrGapNoStep a logic:OperationalCapabilityGap ;
    rdfs:label "an absent OCR capability blocking nothing nameable"@en .
